Package: protocol3Parser
Title: ProtoCOL3 Counts Export Parser
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("Jack", "Pepper", , "jack.pepper@thekids.org.au", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Import and tidy ProtoCOL 3 colony counter reports exported as
    OpenDocument Spreadsheet (.ods) files. Functions are provided to parse
    plate-level metadata and colony count data, extract structured components
    from plate names, and combine results into analysis-ready data frames.
